    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "28 Blackrock Grove, Eden, Blackrock, Cork, is an exceptional three-bedroom duplex apartment presented in superb condition throughout. Owner occupied and meticulously maintained, this impressive home has been recently modernised to a high standard, offering stylish and contemporary living in a highly sought-after residential location.\r\nThe bright and spacious accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, guest WC, utility room and an open-plan kitchen, dining and living area on the ground floor. The recently upgraded kitchen features sleek high-gloss units, quartz countertops and a bespoke glass splashback, creating a modern and functional heart of the home. The living area opens directly onto a large west-facing roof terrace, providing the perfect space for outdoor dining, entertaining and enjoying afternoon and evening sunshine.\r\nUpstairs, there are three generous double bedrooms with built in wardrobes, including a spacious principal bedroom with en-suite bathroom, together with a well-appointed family bathroom. All three bathrooms have been upgraded and feature contemporary wall and floor tiling with quality fittings throughout. Additional benefits include a designated parking space, ample visitor parking, extensive attic storage accessed via Stira stairs, a new boiler and upgraded insulation, resulting in an impressive B energy rating. Conveniently located close to Mahon Point Shopping Centre and Blackrock Marina, this outstanding property combines modern comfort, energy efficiency and an enviable lifestyle location."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation consists of the following:\r\nEntrance / Hallway \r\nTeak front door with stained glass panel inset leading to hallway with glazed floor tiles, radiator, radiator cover, centre light.\r\n\r\nOpen plan Living / Dining Room / Kitchen (12ft 8in x 21ft 8in)\r\nGlazed floor tiles throughout, fitted feature entertainment wall with raised storage units and shelving, recessed lighting, wall hung radiator, door exting to west facing balcony to rear, radiator, radiator cover, window with window blind facing rear of property.\r\n\r\nKitchen (18ft 6in x 8ft 10in)\r\nGlazed floor tiles throughout, upgraded high-gloss fitted kitchen with quartz worktops throughout, stainless steel oven, integrated fridge freezer, 4 ring gas hob with extractor over, feature glass splash back, radiator with radiator cover, window with window blind facing front of property. \r\n\r\nUtility (6ft 2in x 5ft 6in)\r\nGlazed floor tiles, washing machine, and dishwasher with work counter and units over, centre light, expilair, window with window blind facing front of property. \r\n\r\nGuest WC (5ft 7in x 4ft 10in)\r\nRecently upgraded bathroom, fully tiled walls and floor, WC, WHB, wall mirror with light, centre light, expilair.\r\n\r\nStairs / Landing\r\nFully carpeted with 2 centre lights, window with wooden venetian blind facing front of property, radiator, stira stairs leading to floored attic for storage purposes, built in storage in the hotpress. \r\n\r\nBedroom 1 (14ft 5in x 8ft 5in)\r\nCarpet floor covering, built in wardrobes, radiator, centre light, recessed lighting, window with wooden venetian blind, curtain and curtain pole facing rear of property.\r\n\r\nEn-Suite (8ft 5 n x 4ft 5 in)\r\nRecently upgraded bathroom, fully tiled walls and floor with glazed floor tiles, WC, WHB, corner electric shower, wall mirror with shaving light, recessed lighting, expilair.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (12ft 7in x 10ft 7in)\r\nCarpet floor covering, built in wardrobes, radiator, centre light, recessed lighting, window with wooden venetian blind, curtain and curtain pole facing rear of property.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 (14ft 4in x 8ft 10in)\r\nCarpet floor covering, built in wardrobes, radiator, centre light, recessed lighting, window with wooden venetian blind, curtain and curtain pole facing front of property.\r\n\r\nBathroom (8ft 3in x 5ft 6 in)\r\nRecently upgraded bathroom, fully tiled walls and floor, WC, WHB, shower, wall mirror with shaving light, recessed lighting, expilair.\r\n\r\nOutside\r\nTo the front - one designated parking space with ample visitors parking available.\r\nTo the rear - large west facing roof terrace with tiled floor area external  power points, pedestrian gated access to communal gardens to rear (12ft 8in x 11ft 10in)."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Superb 3 bed duplex apartment recently renovated throughout.\r\nWest facing aspect to rear with large roof terrace accessed via living room.\r\nUpgraded high gloss kitchen with quartz counter tops.\r\nDesignated parking space.\r\nHighly sought after location within walking distance of Mahon Point Shopping Centre and Blackrock Marina."
      },
